\description{
Simulates a spatial or spatio-temporal log-Gaussian Cox process (LGCP) on an
arbitrary-dimensional hyperrectangular \code{pp_window}. The marginal first-order
intensity is specified exactly as in \code{simulate_pp()}, while second-order
clustering is induced by a latent Gaussian random field.
